00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:14.520
you know, but here I am. You're probably

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:16.160
not qualified either. You didn't get the

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:17.800
right degree. You don't know everything

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:19.960
